cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use Narrate-to-Sim, please cite the paper given as the preferred
  citation below. To cite the source-only client itself, use this metadata and
  include the exact commit used. This repository contains the source client;
  the paper describes the broader research platform.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
title: "Narrate-to-Sim: Source-Only CARLA Client"
abstract: >-
  Source-only client under addons/narrate_to_sim for Windows 10/11 x64,
  full Python 3.12, stock CARLA 0.9.16 and Town04. Prompt-based scenario
  authoring, explicit ego selection and scripted traffic playback.
